1
00:00:44,679 --> 00:00:46,439
When Wanjun was a kid,

2
00:00:47,399 --> 00:00:48,679
he loved watching opera,

3
00:00:49,679 --> 00:00:52,560
especially red-faced Guan Gong.

4
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:54,799
Remember?

5
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,280
One New Year,

6
00:00:58,039 --> 00:00:59,799
an opera troupe came to our village.

7
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:06,799
He mistook house paint for makeup

8
00:01:06,799 --> 00:01:08,200
and smeared it all over his face.

9
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:10,239
He ended up with a blotchy red face,

10
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,799
and even ran over to show off to us.

11
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:16,239
A blotchy red face.

12
00:01:17,239 --> 00:01:18,120
Blotchy red face...

13
00:01:26,159 --> 00:01:28,120
After graduating from Tokyo Police Academy,

14
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:30,400
why didn't you join the Rongcheng Police Bureau?

15
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:35,079
You think the Rongcheng Police Bureau nowadays

16
00:01:35,799 --> 00:01:37,239
just takes anyone who wants in?

17
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,400
Besides,

18
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,640
the Rongcheng Police Bureau today

19
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:43,560
isn't worth joining anymore.

20
00:01:44,319 --> 00:01:45,239
What do you mean?

21
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:46,799
What do I mean?

22
00:01:48,519 --> 00:01:49,719
Shen Tieshan

23
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:52,040
can't even read.

24
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,079
Lian Ye.

25
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,879
At the flea market,

26
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:10,400
I found a photo of Xiaoyu.

27
00:02:11,159 --> 00:02:12,039
Maybe it'll be of use to you.

28
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,560
Little hero. Little hero.

29
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,919
Little hero.

30
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,840
Your name is Yuna Matsui.

31
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,400
Why aren't you writing it?

32
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:28,479
I... I don't...

33
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:32,599
I don't want to write it.

34
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:33,560
Fool!

35
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:39,639
Mr. Matsui.

36
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,719
That case has been closed.

37
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,400
You're very clever.

38
00:02:45,719 --> 00:02:47,680
You made Shen Tieshan take the fall for everything

39
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:50,479
and pinned the raw opium trade on Li Zhenhai.

40
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,280
He has already been dismissed,

41
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,759
losing control over the Rongcheng Chamber of Commerce.

42
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:57,759
However, Min River Wharf is now heavily guarded.

43
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:00,120
Our raw opium business has ground to a halt.

44
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,960
The Major General is very displeased about this

45
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,479
and sent a letter of reprimand.

46
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:06,280
For the next mission,

47
00:03:07,039 --> 00:03:08,439
no mistakes will be tolerated.

48
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:09,080
Yes, sir.

49
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:26,400
The Sea Goddess Temple murders involve too many people,

50
00:03:26,479 --> 00:03:27,520
and the fallout is too severe.

51
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,680
The Chamber voted collectively to revoke

52
00:03:29,199 --> 00:03:30,960
your Rongcheng Chamber of Commerce post.

53
00:03:31,599 --> 00:03:34,639
From now on, you're no different from any other merchant,

54
00:03:35,039 --> 00:03:36,479
just an ordinary businessman.

55
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,360
Those opportunistic snobs!

56
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,960
They took plenty of kickbacks from me before.

57
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:47,680
The death of Lian Ye's family...

58
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:50,039
did you have anything to do with it?

59
00:03:50,319 --> 00:03:50,840
You...

60
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:53,280
Even you don't believe me?

61
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,639
After Old Lian died,

62
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:56,280
I did take over his business,

63
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:58,080
but if I hadn't,

64
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:59,360
someone else would have.

65
00:04:00,199 --> 00:04:03,000
I... I would never take a life!

66
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,159
Mingyuan!

67
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:12,800
You little brat!

68
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,439
Do you even see me as your father anymore?

69
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:21,879
Boss Xu.

70
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:25,199
Hua Moli has been waiting for your new tea for so long.

71
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,759
The moment this batch was ready,

72
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,399
I rushed to bring it straight to you.

73
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:43,839
Captain Xu, glad I finally caught you.

74
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,839
With the Sea Goddess Temple murders causing such a stir,

75
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:48,199
what's really going on?

76
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,720
The murders are just a cover.

77
00:04:49,959 --> 00:04:51,600
Smuggling raw opium is the real objective.

78
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:54,839
I suspect the Japanese are behind it.

79
00:04:56,759 --> 00:04:57,920
The scourge of raw opium

80
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:59,360
drains a person's lifeblood

81
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:01,160
and crushes their spirit.

82
00:05:01,439 --> 00:05:02,600
Their intentions are utterly vile.

83
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:04,839
By the way,

84
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,279
those two childhood friends of yours

85
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:10,160
are crucial to stabilizing Rongcheng.

86
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,800
You must assist them

87
00:05:12,399 --> 00:05:14,480
and keep them from falling into the Japanese trap.

88
00:05:15,199 --> 00:05:16,519
Rest assured, Captain Xu.

89
00:05:16,879 --> 00:05:19,560
I'll help them both on duty and in private.

90
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:29,920
Father.

91
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:32,639
Mother.

92
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,920
Your son has brought back

93
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,399
our Lian family heirloom.

94
00:05:42,319 --> 00:05:43,279
Rest easy.

95
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,439
I will uncover the truth

96
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:48,439
and avenge your deaths.

97
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:50,839
And I will...

98
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,360
I will definitely bring Xiaoyu back.

99
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,759
Who's there?

100
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,319
It's me.

101
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,279
Lian Ye.

102
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:29,720
I know you got involved in the Sea Goddess Temple murders

103
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,639
for the sake of the Sanshan Gang.

104
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:33,680
I stripped you of your post.

105
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:36,000
You aren't angry with me, are you?

106
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,079
Of course not.

107
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,639
Chief, you removed me

108
00:06:39,879 --> 00:06:41,120
to protect me,

109
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,800
so I could keep a low profile.

110
00:06:44,079 --> 00:06:45,240
I'm glad you understand.

111
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,759
I remember two years ago,

112
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,759
after graduating from Tokyo Police Academy,

113
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:55,360
while investigating my parents' murder,

114
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,800
I was hunted down by enemies.

115
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,800
You took the risk

116
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:01,800
to bring me into the Sanshan Gang

117
00:07:02,199 --> 00:07:03,199
and give me shelter.

118
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,120
I, Lian Ye, swear

119
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,560
that I will always protect the Sanshan Gang

120
00:07:08,279 --> 00:07:10,639
and stand by the fishermen.

121
00:07:20,399 --> 00:07:21,519
Ghost!

122
00:07:23,639 --> 00:07:24,480
Eat something.

123
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,120
You can't just not eat.

124
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,839
Come on, just have a bite.

125
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:30,959
Old Hou.

126
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,439
What are you busy with?

127
00:07:32,759 --> 00:07:34,519
Brother Lian, what brings you here?

128
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:36,639
Old Li and the others

129
00:07:36,639 --> 00:07:38,279
said you haven't been out fishing lately.

130
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:39,839
Worried something happened,

131
00:07:40,279 --> 00:07:41,120
I came to check on you.

132
00:07:43,639 --> 00:07:45,120
Ghost! A ghost!

133
00:07:45,839 --> 00:07:46,839
What happened to him?

134
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:48,839
This kid...

135
00:07:48,839 --> 00:07:51,079
went out on Ghost Festival and got possessed.

136
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,759
He collapsed at Laoshu Slope.

137
00:07:52,759 --> 00:07:53,800
Ever since he woke up,

138
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,120
it's like he's lost his soul,

139
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,319
babbling away like crazy.

140
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,519
Taking care of him,

141
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,680
I haven't been able to leave the house.

142
00:08:00,519 --> 00:08:01,279
Have you seen a doctor?

143
00:08:01,399 --> 00:08:05,160
Yes. The doctor said he's in severe shock

144
00:08:05,639 --> 00:08:06,920
and needs time to recuperate.

145
00:08:07,639 --> 00:08:09,240
Is this Hou Shuisheng's home?

146
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,879
Huang Jiaxing and Tang Jintu's families

147
00:08:24,079 --> 00:08:25,600
reported them missing for a week.

148
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,279
According to our investigation,

149
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,360
on the night they vanished,

150
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,160
Hou Shuisheng was right there with them.

151
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:32,480
We need to take him in for questioning.

152
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:34,639
There's a ghost!

153
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,559
Go away! Go away! Go away!

154
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:38,120
Go away! Go away!

155
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,440
Look at the state he's in right now.

156
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:45,039
Taking him in won't get you any answers.

157
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:46,639
Lian Ye.

158
00:08:47,039 --> 00:08:48,279
I know you're trying to protect him,

159
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,600
but two young fishermen

160
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,440
have vanished without a trace.

161
00:08:50,519 --> 00:08:52,120
He's the only one with any clues.

162
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,360
We need to find them as soon as possible.

163
00:08:53,679 --> 00:08:54,519
Otherwise,

164
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,320
he'll be the prime suspect.

165
00:09:14,919 --> 00:09:15,720
Hou Shuisheng.

166
00:09:16,679 --> 00:09:17,519
Don't be afraid.

167
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:19,519
I just have a few quick questions.

168
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,240
On the night of the Ghost Festival,

169
00:09:23,639 --> 00:09:25,240
why were you at Laoshu Slope?

170
00:09:29,879 --> 00:09:30,519
To eat...

171
00:09:37,399 --> 00:09:38,279
What the hell?

172
00:09:41,279 --> 00:09:43,200
I know what those brats were up to.

173
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:44,799
Stealing offerings.

174
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:48,519
What did you see that night?

175
00:09:58,039 --> 00:10:00,440
Ghosts... So many ghosts!

176
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,879
Carrying... carrying a coffin!

177
00:10:11,919 --> 00:10:13,639
The three of you went to Laoshu Slope together.

178
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,039
You came back,

179
00:10:15,799 --> 00:10:16,720
so where did they go?

180
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:27,279
They became ghosts, too!

181
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:00,600
Time of death:

182
00:11:01,039 --> 00:11:02,360
3:00 a.m., July 15.

183
00:11:04,799 --> 00:11:05,480
Cause of death:

184
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:08,159
Cervical spine injury causing critical nerve

185
00:11:08,279 --> 00:11:09,240
and blood vessel rupture.

186
00:11:09,559 --> 00:11:10,480
Simply put,

187
00:11:10,559 --> 00:11:11,960
their necks were snapped while still alive.

188
00:11:14,799 --> 00:11:15,559
In other words,

189
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,200
they were tied to stakes after death.

190
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,559
This was premeditated murder.

191
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:21,240
According to Hou Shuisheng's statement,

192
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:23,200
that night, he, Huang Jiaxing, and Tang Jintu

193
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,840
went to Laoshu Slope

194
00:11:24,919 --> 00:11:26,039
to steal sacrificial offerings.

195
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:29,519
They happened upon ghosts carrying a coffin.

196
00:11:30,159 --> 00:11:30,879
Which means,

197
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:33,240
they ran into a group of people carrying cargo.

198
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:36,240
Huang Jiaxing and Tang Jintu were murdered,

199
00:11:36,679 --> 00:11:40,120
matching his claim they became ghosts too.

200
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:41,919
Hou Shuisheng witnessed it firsthand

201
00:11:42,639 --> 00:11:43,919
and was driven mad with fear.

202
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,480
Which means...

203
00:11:46,759 --> 00:11:48,559
he knows who the killer is.

204
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:01,399
Mr. Matsui,

205
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,399
I gave them strict orders

206
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:05,000
to eliminate every last one of them,

207
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:06,799
but I never expected

208
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,679
one would slip through in the end.

209
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:11,360
How many shipments to Rongcheng are left?

210
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,039
Just the last one.

211
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:14,440
This shipment

212
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:16,879
is vital to the Major General's strategy.

213
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:18,799
Not a word can leak out.

214
00:12:19,559 --> 00:12:20,840
No, but...

215
00:12:20,879 --> 00:12:22,440
the police already know!

216
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:27,879
Useless fool!

217
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:42,559
Make sure you eliminate Hou Shuisheng.

218
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,519
This is extremely important to me.

219
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:46,840
This is an absolute order.

220
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:50,039
You don't want what you did exposed, do you?

221
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,840
It was terrifying.

222
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,080
Absolutely terrifying.

223
00:13:06,759 --> 00:13:08,799
Sister Dieyi, let me have another drink.

224
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:13,440
Thanks, Sister Dieyi.

225
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,120
What's wrong with him?

226
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:21,759
The bodies at Laoshu Slope terrified him.

227
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:22,840
Let him drink some more.

228
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:26,919
I just don't get it.

229
00:13:27,039 --> 00:13:28,720
They're already dead.

230
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,080
Why turn the corpses

231
00:13:30,759 --> 00:13:32,639
into what looks like two tree stumps,

232
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,519
and set them on fire with torches?

233
00:13:35,679 --> 00:13:38,480
Isn't it obvious? To scare people.

234
00:13:40,159 --> 00:13:41,399
Was that really necessary?

235
00:13:42,639 --> 00:13:45,720
I heard that over at Laoshu Slope,

236
00:13:46,159 --> 00:13:48,320
smugglers used to bypass the checkpoints.

237
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:51,279
Since the killer murdered them

238
00:13:51,679 --> 00:13:53,240
and used such a method

239
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:55,000
to warn everyone else to stay away

240
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,480
and not court death,

241
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,559
it means

242
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,519
this shipment is no ordinary haul.

243
00:14:07,519 --> 00:14:08,159
Slow down.

244
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:11,960
Keep up.

245
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:19,799
Move in!

246
00:14:20,519 --> 00:14:21,200
Freeze, everyone!

247
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:22,240
Hands up! Don't move!

248
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,840
Don't move! Stay right there!

249
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:24,679
Halt!

250
00:14:29,159 --> 00:14:29,840
Captain Li.

251
00:14:30,799 --> 00:14:32,960
Smuggling falls under the Sanshan Gang.

252
00:14:33,279 --> 00:14:35,840
The fishermen's murders are police business.

253
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:39,720
Gentlemen, why don't we open the crates first

254
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:42,240
before deciding who gets the men and cargo?

255
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:45,320
Open them.

256
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:04,200
It's just some regular fabric.

257
00:15:04,399 --> 00:15:05,879
Did you really need to make such a fuss?

258
00:15:07,799 --> 00:15:10,080
W-We just wanted to make some quick cash.

259
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,240
You can have the people and the goods.

260
00:15:12,559 --> 00:15:13,279
Let's go.

261
00:15:35,879 --> 00:15:36,840
What are you doing?

262
00:15:39,559 --> 00:15:40,720
I brought him some food.

263
00:15:41,919 --> 00:15:43,720
No need. He can leave now.

264
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:48,759
Ghost!

265
00:15:50,519 --> 00:15:51,080
Ghost!

266
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:52,879
Come here, all of you.

267
00:15:58,440 --> 00:15:59,519
Do you recognize this man?

268
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:04,759
No, no...

269
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:07,000
What about this one?

270
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:12,720
No...

271
00:16:13,879 --> 00:16:14,639
I don't know him.

272
00:16:17,519 --> 00:16:18,480
Out of everyone here,

273
00:16:18,799 --> 00:16:20,080
have you seen any of them before?

274
00:16:25,919 --> 00:16:27,679
Master, in the state he's in,

275
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:29,720
he wouldn't remember even if he had.

276
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:46,240
Did you catch the killer?

277
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,519
He can't identify him.

278
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:54,720
Soon, he'll be able to.

279
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:01,080
This is Dr. Hao,

280
00:17:01,919 --> 00:17:03,759
a renowned master of acupuncture.

281
00:17:04,039 --> 00:17:05,400
A while back, someone went mad,

282
00:17:05,559 --> 00:17:06,680
and Dr. Hao gave him a few needles.

283
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:09,160
In less than three days, he improved.

284
00:17:09,559 --> 00:17:12,039
Xiao Hou's condition isn't that severe.

285
00:17:12,359 --> 00:17:13,839
With a few needles from Dr. Hao,

286
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,559
I guarantee that afterward,

287
00:17:15,559 --> 00:17:16,839
his head will be clear,

288
00:17:17,039 --> 00:17:19,279
and he'll identify the killer right away.

289
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:20,599
That would be wonderful!

290
00:17:21,279 --> 00:17:22,279
Much obliged, Dr. Hao.

291
00:17:24,519 --> 00:17:25,200
This way.

292
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:08,720
I really didn't want to see you here,

293
00:18:09,039 --> 00:18:09,759
Xu Jie.

294
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:15,000
Master.

295
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:18,200
When did you start suspecting me?

296
00:18:18,839 --> 00:18:20,000
The moment Wanjun died.

297
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:23,119
The first thing you said when you came to me:

298
00:18:25,319 --> 00:18:26,759
"Master, Wanjun..."

299
00:18:27,319 --> 00:18:28,319
"Wanjun committed suicide."

300
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,160
There hadn't even been an autopsy yet.

301
00:18:30,319 --> 00:18:32,480
How were you so sure he killed himself?

302
00:18:33,079 --> 00:18:34,359
That could've just been a slip of the tongue.

303
00:18:34,559 --> 00:18:36,119
I tried convincing myself of that, too.

304
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:39,119
But every single mission after that came up empty.

305
00:18:39,279 --> 00:18:40,799
Someone was definitely leaking information.

306
00:18:41,079 --> 00:18:43,319
And the only person who knew all my plans

307
00:18:43,319 --> 00:18:46,160
was you, who stayed by my side the entire time.

308
00:18:46,839 --> 00:18:48,519
During that last raid on the smugglers,

309
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:51,519
you tipped them off and leaked word,

310
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:53,559
which is why we walked away empty-handed, right?

311
00:18:54,319 --> 00:18:55,400
Smuggling fabric

312
00:18:55,839 --> 00:18:57,480
was nothing more than a diversion.

313
00:18:58,039 --> 00:18:59,559
It was to cover up what the true culprit

314
00:19:00,039 --> 00:19:02,039
really wanted to transport, wasn't it?

315
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:04,400
So you staged this whole charade,

316
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:06,000
bringing in a doctor to push me

317
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,160
into attacking Hou Shuisheng,

318
00:19:07,440 --> 00:19:08,319
just to lure the snake out of its hole?

319
00:19:08,960 --> 00:19:10,960
Who's really pulling your strings?
